{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"e187b7edb3a364902fa4e0e95070b5a0ce4dd2adb2e3aff0260cfa85540b67d4","digest":{"component_or_area":"op-cert merge-gate verification lane","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/verify_opcert.py","src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py","src/rebar/_config_schema.py",".github/workflows/verify-identity.yaml","verify.opcert_enforce_since","verify.require_environment","attestations[completion-verifier]",".rebar/trusted_environments.yaml","rebar verify-opcert","opcert.opcert_from_record","signing.sign_opcert_manifest","authorship.resolve_event_commit","rebar trusted-env add","rebar trusted-env revoke","added_at_log_position","revoked_at_log_position"],"problem_keywords":["merge-gate verification","op-cert enforcement","completion-verifier attestation","merged log walk","key validity era anchor","grandfathering","authoritative-input rule"],"propositions":["A CLI entrypoint rebar verify-opcert reads verify.require_environment and verify.opcert_enforce_since from config, walks the merged log grouped by ticket, and verifies each in-scope ticket's required-kind op-cert, exiting 1 iff an enforced ticket lacks a valid op-cert.","The merge-gate verifies op-cert material_fingerprint against the authoritative ticket state recomputed from the merged-log walk, not the plaintext record value, and requires merged_log_commit from the signature-verified payload to be an ancestor of gated HEAD and within the enforce-since floor.","Op-cert storage anchor is the introducing commit of the SIGNATURE event (ticket's close-STATUS event for missing op-certs), resolved by the gate from its own merged-log walk; key validity is evaluated at that storage anchor, not the cert's self-chosen merged_log_commit, preventing revoked-key backdating attacks.","Era boundaries in trusted_environments.yaml are tickets-branch log positions (added_at_log_position/revoked_at_log_position) stamped via rebar trusted-env add|revoke helper; revocation without a grandfather pin fails all that key's certs; certs stored at or before the pin stay valid.",".github/workflows/verify-identity.yaml gains a rebar verify-opcert step in the same job with config-driven posture and boundary, advisory until verify.opcert_enforce_since covers op-cert-bearing commits, with a CI-trigger audit comment enumerating included triggers."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819437996944230,"uuid":"30eb1eab-fedb-430b-8ce6-5c208191e3df"}